# Remove Embedded Local Whisper And Simplify Docker To One Compose File

## Summary
Remove Podly’s embedded local Whisper support and collapse Docker packaging to a single CPU-only app image. There will be no `lite` build, no GPU variants, no separate compose overlays, and no in-container PyTorch/Whisper path. Local transcription remains supported by running a dedicated OpenAI-compatible transcription service and configuring Podly with `WHISPER_TYPE=remote`.

